+	/// @brief Read the airframe attitude, and hold the last one while no new estimate arrives.
+	/// @return rotation from the airframe FRD body frame to the NED earth frame
+	matrix::Quatf vehicleAttitude();
+	/// @brief Compute the frame that the reported attitude is measured against, which the
+	/// lock flags of the report declare.
+	/// @param lock_flags ROLL_LOCK, PITCH_LOCK and YAW_LOCK bits of the report
+	/// @param q_vehicle airframe attitude in the NED earth frame
